{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的纵向阅读负担明显高于Y，尤其S01、S06，感受词密集时容易让观众忙于扫字，顾不上听音乐；Y的左右分栏更容易快速定位。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y确实更容易扫读，但压缩过程中损失了一些关键心理因果和微妙转折，例如S08的暖意并不意味着想回头、S09害怕孤单到可能再次忍受委屈，以及S12不再逼自己选边的心理整合。X通过加亮的关键语句和更细致、与音乐时点对应的感受描述，让人物为什么反复动摇、如何逐渐理解自己、最终怎样作出选择更加清楚。尤其在情绪层次和音乐表现的具体对应上，X明显更细腻，整体叙事也更连贯。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1457212e-d87e-4cf9-8dcd-7948ee6a4aa1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T154711851216Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:47:56.563895+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e71bc1c06bdcab9c9cab76ec17edb7cd76babb124af3527bf6f410b8fc367376", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt